	(text "The nets carry the core sheet's names of the M5-Bus pins they reach:\nSYS_P033 (bus pin 12, 3.3V) is MCU_VDD; IMU_SDA (17) is EXT_G21;\nIMU_SCL (18) is EXT_G22; MIC_CLK (24) is EXT_G0; MIC_DAT (26) is EXT_G34.\nBus pins the expansion sheet leaves unconnected are drawn unconnected here.\nDesignators are the vendor's +100: its BUS1, U1, U2, R1, C1-C3."
